      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "address, Arabic",
          "value": "<p>To my lord and master Ab\u016b Ya\u1e25ya Nahray ben Nissim the Maghrib\u012b, may God prolong his life and maintain his might and assistance and peace.</p>\n<p>From Israel ibn Sahl\u016bn the Maghrib\u012b.</p>\n<p>Fust\u0101t. If God wills it.</p>\n<p>Al-\u1e24usayn ibn \u2018Al\u012b and his son, \u2018Umar ibn Y\u016bsuf.</p>\n<p></p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
